ibraries were prepared using the Rubicon ThruPLEX DNA-seq Kit from 1 ng of purified ChIP DNA or input DNA according to the manufacturer's protocol.	56354852	4226613900	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR904/007/SRR9048037/SRR9048037.fastq.gz	8f0f48a533778bb3140e7963d5e536e7	2398510712
